# Grok and Cursor pairing

`cursor.pairing` is set at `@init-grok`. Values: `together` | `grok-only` | `cursor-only`.
There is no factory default. If it is `unset`, stop and ask.

- `together`: Grok inference (LangChain / xAI SDK / Vercel) **and** Cursor SDK. Two keys. One LangSmith project.
- `grok-only`: inference client only. No Cursor SDK.
- `cursor-only`: Cursor SDK only. Grok from `Cursor.models.list()`. No direct xAI client.

Together is allowed. It is not implied.
